    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d192">

                <pb facs="0296" n="276" sameAs="frus:frus1950v07/pg276"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">330/6–2850: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the United States Mission at
                        the United Nations </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-07-01T17:00:00-04:00">July 1, 1950—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Dept expects provide full reply questions raised Para 5(<hi
                        rendition="#italic">a</hi>) ur 554 Jun 28 soonest possible. Meanwhile fol
                    present gen views Dept may be helpful.</p>
                <p>Action to prevent attack on Formosa and to prevent Natl Govt air and sea
                    operations against mainland taken as immediate security measure to preserve
                    peace in Pacific and without prejudice to pol questions affecting Chi Govt. No
                    change anticipated in relations between US Govt and Chi Govt.</p>
                <p> Dept believes Amb Gross expressed this very well in his conversation with Lie
                    (ur 569 June 30<anchor n="1" xml:id="d192-f1"/>) when he pointed out US move
                    respecting Formosa of mil significance only and believes USUN shld continue
                    adhere this explanation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
